From b12b6298b2ba21ad80466bf1c986d5da5f17f3ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxime Basset <112871003+maximebasset1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:49:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add predictions page and widgets

- [routes/predictions.js]: new /predictions page
- [utils/predictions]: engine data loader with cache, home and driver summaries, display helpers
- [views/predictions]: predictions page, home widget, driver widget
- [app.js]: register route, load home summary, share display helpers
- [routes/drivers.js]: pass driver prediction to the driver page
- [views/home/home.ejs, views/drivers/driver.ejs, views/partials/header.ejs]: include widgets and menu link
- [config.json, locales/en.json]: settings and texts
- [public/stylesheets/style.css]: rebuilt with npm run build:css
---
